pve-ups-panel (2.2.4) stable; urgency=low

  * Config.pm: fix NOTIFYCMD disappearing from upsmon.conf. Previously
    _build_upsmon_conf only preserved NOTIFYCMD if it already existed in
    the file; since it is only written by Notify.pm when the user saves
    notification rules, any device add/delete before that first save
    would produce a upsmon.conf without NOTIFYCMD, silently disabling
    all notifications. Fix: add $NOTIFY_CMD constant to Config.pm and
    always emit NOTIFYCMD in _build_upsmon_conf output. NOTIFYFLAG lines
    are still read from the existing file so Notify.pm's live updates
    are preserved across config rewrites.

